ui-the-containers-for-both-filled-and-outlined-text-fields-provide-the-same-functionality-cha = The containers for both filled and outlined text fields provide the same functionality. Changes to color and thickness of stroke help provide clear visual cues for interaction. Make sure the container outline has a minimum contrast of 3:1 to the background.

