ui-use-optional-24dp-images-or-icons-to-clarify-input-or-expose-an-actual-action-such-as-clea = Use optional 24dp images or icons to clarify input or expose an actual action, such as clearing entered text. The microphone below is a non-interactive icon illustration; this example does not record or transcribe audio.

